GIF Search extension by josephschmitt and its contributors, MIT licensed.
The exact Raycast MIT notice is retained in licenses/raycast-extensions-MIT.txt.
The existing repository TypeScript sources and UPSTREAM.md are preserved.
Original installed artwork is retained without modification; no trademark
rights or independent authorship of the artwork are claimed.

