file origins and SHA-256 hashes. The installed package revision is unknown;
the separately pinned upstream snapshot is metadata context, not the asserted
revision of the installed assets. No API credentials are embedded.

Rust dependencies are resolved in Cargo.lock under their respective licenses.
The SDK is pinned to git revision 9f91afcc071c3f301414dc62b33cfeac7d89a0cf.
